(7529283, 1203460, 48710, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning image of a scene of great intrinsic interest: the crown jewels of our technical era. I would have wished to know the lens and camera that produced this fish-eye view - which at this viewing magnification looks crisp and sharp. I would be mortified if it were a GoPro or a clip on/smart phone shot!</td>', 'This is a stunning image of a scene of great intrinsic interest: the crown jewels of our technical era. I would have wished to know the lens and camera that produced this fish-eye view - which at this viewing magnification looks crisp and sharp. I would be mortified if it were a GoPro or a clip on/smart phone shot!', '2017-08-16 11:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
